        "workup_and_crystallization": "Characterization by EA, FT-IR, 1H NMR and ESI-MS (m/z 1852.76 for {[Zn2(L)3Cl2(μ2-OH)(μ3-OH)2La3(N3)]}+ in MeCN). Crystal structure determined only for the Er analogue 4·2H2O.",
